l":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199313542","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4318390-1834602721199122","game_id":"steam-4318390","kind":"update","title":"Echoes of Aethelgard Demo 1.0.2 Patch Notes","summary":"1.0.2 -Fixed a bug where some enemies would not fade when being defeated. -Removed the audio for both dangerous enemy variants and lowhealth due to being initially too intense and disruptive to gameplay.-Fixed an issue where going to the armory screen again would break the Main Menu button.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-08T14:51:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721199122","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4318390-1834602721186030","game_id":"steam-4318390","kind":"update","title":"Echoes of Aethelgard Demo 1.0.1 Patch Notes","summary":"1.0.1 -Added leaderboard tracking to the demo. -Fixed a bug where the main menu button would not work in the armory screen and would require the player to close out of the game.-Adjusted ambience audio to be more tolerable.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-03T22:01:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721186030","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4318390-1833334318571425","game_id":"steam-4318390","kind":"announcement","title":"⚔️ Echoes of Aethelgard Approved for Steam Bullet Fest + Demo Date!","summary":"Heed the call, heroes!We have some massive news from the forge. MrKokoGames LLC is incredibly proud to announce that Echoes of Aethelgard has been officially selected by Valve to participate in the upcoming Steam Bullet Fest starting June 8th!To celebrate, we are letting you brave the swarm early. The Official Free Demo will be launching right here on Steam on June 1st! > This public demo features our core survival gameplay, initial character progression, and the intense bullet-heaven action you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-22T11:29:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318571425","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4318390-1832700592786698","game_id":"steam-4318390","kind":"announcement","title":"⚔️ A Glimpse into the Aethelgard: Upcoming Demo Announcement!","summary":"Hello everyone! We’ve been working hard in the forge, and it’s finally time to share a piece of Echoes of Aethelgard with you. We are thrilled to announce that a free demo will be launching soon.Why a Demo First? We want you to get your hands on the core gameplay early. This demo features the first level and our unique Rotating Aura system. Your feedback now will help us polish the final experience before the full release.The Road to 7,000 Wishlists 📈 As an independent studio (MrKokoGames LLC), ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-13T15:24:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592786698","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4318390":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:14Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:13Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4318390":"2026-10-26T12:07:14Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4318390":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:13Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:13Z","status":"ok","erro